### Admin login (created on startup from app.admin.*)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@wine.local", "password": "admin12345"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Customer registration (adult)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "john@example.com", "password": "password123", "birthDate": "1990-05-20"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Customer login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "john@example.com", "password": "password123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Catalog with filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wines?type=RED&country=Italy&maxPrice=30&page=0&size=10

### Admin: add wine
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/wines
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Malbec Reserva", "type": "RED", "country": "Argentina", "region": "Mendoza",
 "vintage": 2021, "price": 18.90, "stock": 25, "description": "Dark berries and spices"}

### Cart: add item
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"wineId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### Cart: view
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pay (stub)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

